===Etymology 1===
[[File:Grapes05.jpg|thumb|upright|A bunch of '''grapes''' ({{senseno|en|Q10978}})]]

From {{inh|en|enm|grape}}, from {{der|en|fro|[[grape]], [[grappe]], [[crape]]|t=cluster of fruit or flowers, bunch of grapes}}, from {{m|fro|[[graper]], [[craper]]|t=to pick grapes|lit=to hook}}, of {{cog|gem}} origin, from {{der|en|frk|*krappō|t=hook}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*greb-|t=hook}}, {{m|ine-pro|*gremb-|t=crooked, uneven}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ger-|t=to turn, bend, twist}}. Cognate with {{cog|dum|krappe|t=hook}}, {{cog|goh|krapfo|t=hook}} (whence {{cog|de|Krapfen|t=Berliner doughnut}}. {{doublet|en|grappa}}. More at {{l|en|cramp}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|Q10978}} {{lb|en|countable}} A small, round, smooth-skinned edible [[fruit]], usually purple, red, or green, that grows in [[bunch]]es on vines of genus ''[[Vitis]]''.
#: {{ux|en|'''Grapes''' give us whole-fruit snacks, grape juice, raisins, wine, and more.}}
# {{lb|en|countable|uncountable}} A woody [[vine]] of genus ''[[Vitis]]'' that bears clusters of grapes; a [[grapevine]].
#: {{ux|en|wild '''grape''' covering the back slope}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} Any of various [[fruit]]s or [[plant]]s with varying resemblances to those of genus ''Vitis'' but belonging to other genera; their edibility varies.
#: {{ux|en|sea '''grape'''; tail '''grape'''}}
# {{lb|en|countable|uncountable}} A dark [[purple|purplish]]-[[red]] [[colour]], the colour of many grapes.
#: {{ux|en|For those seeking purply tones, the paint colors available include mauve, magenta, and '''grape'''.}}
#: {{color panel|2F2140}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} {{clipping of|en|grapeshot}}.
#: {{ux|en|men mowed down by '''grape'''}}
#* {{RQ:Poe Pym|passage=The boarding-nettings were up, the guns double-shotted with '''grape''' and canister, and the swivels loaded with canisters of musket-balls.}}
# {{lb|en|pathology}} A [[mangy]] [[tumour]] on a [[horse]]'s [[leg]].
# {{lb|en|US|naval|_|slang}} A purple-shirted [[technician]] responsible for [[refuel]]ing [[aircraft]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1998|title=Approach|volume=43|issue=10|page=10
|passage=I was horrified to see three '''grapes''' standing by the aircraft with the hose still connected.}}
# {{senseid|en|head}} {{lb|en|AAVE|slang}} A person's [[head]].
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:head}}

